                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "From the NICU, to the KY state senate, to the House floor, my new bill is over a decade in the making.\n\nI talked with @SpectrumNews1KY about our experience fighting for the care our twins needed in the NICU and how my bill would help families nationwide \ud83d\udc47 https://t.co/7krEwFFHNz",
