                "text": "Black babies have the highest mortality rate in the country\u2014they're also 4x more likely to die of complications from low birth weight.\n\nMy bill works to address this disparity by creating an insurance mandate for the nutrition preemies need to survive. https://t.co/fOwAulO1sT",
